<div id="preamble">
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p><a href="https://asciidoctor.org">Asciidoctor</a> is an open source text processor and publishing toolchain for converting <a href="https://asciidoctor.org">AsciiDoc</a> markup into HTML, DocBook and custom formats.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>This document provides a high-level view of the changes introduced in Asciidoctor by release.
For a detailed view of what has changed, refer to the <a href="https://github.com/asciidoctor/asciidoctor/commits/main">commit history</a> on GitHub.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
